        <mxCell id="-DPXh-h7QqhF4jSscgDO-72" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;EV fast-charging hub (2.2 MW peak)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Utility 20 kV (S&quot;k max/min 300/200 MVA), 2.5 km cable to the hub ring main unit.&lt;br&gt;TR1 (1.6 MVA) supplies eight 150 kW DC chargers in two bays; TR2 (1.25 MVA) supplies two&lt;br&gt;350 kW high-power chargers, a 400 kW / 1 MWh buffer battery (discharging) and 100 kWp canopy PV.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Try:&lt;/b&gt; Load Flow – transformer loading at full charging demand, LV voltage drop,&lt;br&gt;peak shaving by the buffer battery; Short Circuit IEC 60909 – LV breaker ratings;&lt;br&gt;set the battery to 0 or close the bus coupler and compare." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=4;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;spacingRight=8;fontSize=12;fillColor=#e8f5e9;strokeColor=#81c784;" vertex="1" parent="-DPXh-h7QqhF4jSscgDO-1">
